<title>MEXICO: Mexico foreign investment up 11.29 pct in Aug.</title>
<headline>Mexico foreign investment up 11.29 pct in Aug.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreign investment in Mexican securities rose 11.29 percent in August to $35.228 billion from $31.655 billion in July, the Mexican Stock Exchange (BMV) said on Monday.</p>
<p>There was a 14.01 percent increase in investment in the money market over the month to $2.288 billion on August 23, while total foreign investment in stocks was up 11.10 percent to $32.940 billion, it said.  </p>
